This is an unofficial fan-made mod for GTFO. It is not made, endorsed or supported by 10 Chambers Collective.
GTFO and its game data belong to their owners; no file taken from the game is included in this package.

Third-party material in this package: none.
Everything in the zip is Forge's own work: ForgeReplay.dll built from this repository, manifest.json, icon.png, the language files and the documentation.
icon.png is generated by Forge's badge template; its lettering is outlined from the Teko Bold and Saira Bold typefaces (SIL Open Font
License 1.1). No font file is included.

The package is compiled against BepInEx, HarmonyX, Il2CppInterop, GTFO-API and the game's interop assemblies, which the mod manager installs
separately as the dependencies named in manifest.json; none of them is included here.
At run time it uses the Forge libraries ForgeCore, ForgeUI, ForgeAudio and ForgeVisual, installed as their own packages with their own
LICENSE and NOTICE. ForgeAudio carries the NVorbis Ogg Vorbis decoder (NVorbis 0.10.5, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2020 Andrew Ward,
https://github.com/NVorbis/NVorbis) with its licence text; ForgeReplay does not include a copy.